# astrion-skill v1
goal: End meeting mode — restore notifications and volume
trigger:
  - phrase: "end meeting"
  - phrase: "meeting over"
  - phrase: "call ended"
do: |
  Disable Do Not Disturb. Restore volume to pre-meeting level (from
  the 'meeting' graph node started by start-meeting). Update the
  graph node with end timestamp and duration. Show notification:
  "Meeting ended — duration X minutes."
constraints:
  level: L2
  budget_tokens: 200
  reversibility: FREE
